contract Recognized
parties we, customer, bank

asset Note
  amount HKD
  holder we
  due date
  size GB
  fee_rate 3%
  codes list text
  region text

can offer by we
  drafted -> active
can sell by holder to customer
  over 5_000 requires in person
  holder = customer
  requires region = 香港
can lend by we to bank
  requires not drafted
  requires amount * fee_rate > HKD 1
  requires size > 1.5 GB
  holder = bank
when due customer pays
